cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DUET: fast two-part hurdle testing for single-cell differential expression in Python"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pachinger-Molnár"
    given-names: "Bence"
