license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"   # concept DOI, added after the first Zenodo release
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - differential expression
  - hurdle model
  - MAST
  - pseudoreplication
  - Python
  - scverse
abstract: >-
  DUET (Detection-Expression Unified Test) implements the MAST-style two-part
  hurdle test for single-cell differential expression in NumPy/SciPy, operating
  directly on sparse AnnData objects without an R toolchain. It reproduces MAST's
  coefficients and gene ranking while running two orders of magnitude faster on
  the two-group design, and reports an underflow-safe -log10 p that preserves
  gene rankings lost to double-precision underflow at realistic cell counts.
